; Reads: current-age, can-build-with-escrow farm, gl-strategy,
;        pending farm, gl-current-build-item, wood, farm count.
; Writes: wood escrow percentage = 0.
; Escrow: set-escrow-percentage wood 0; release-escrow wood.
; Pending guard: up-pending-objects c: farm < 1.
; Command: build farm.
; Completion observer: none.
; Jump: none; fall-through -> 1803.
(defrule
