)

; ============================================================
; R07 RULE 1805
; ============================================================
; Reads: gl-strategy, gl-current-build-item, gl-build-progress.
; Writes: wood escrow percentage = LOW-ESCROW;
;         gl-current-build-item = FARMS.
; Escrow: set-escrow-percentage wood LOW-ESCROW.
; Pending guard: none.
; Command: none.
; Completion observer: none.
